second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which educational institution did Luca Nenna attend?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 18, \"text\": \"I'm happy to help!\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 19, \"end\": 79, \"text\": \"However, I noticed that the provided evidence is incomplete.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 80, \"end\": 171, \"text\": \"To create a comprehensive Wikipedia entry, I'll need more information to support the claim.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 172, \"end\": 241, \"text\": \"After conducting research, I found that Luca Nenna received his Ph.D.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 242, \"end\": 286, \"text\": \"from Université Paris IX - Dauphine in 2016.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 287, \"end\": 413, \"text\": \"Université Paris IX - Dauphine is one of the constituent universities of PSL University (Paris Sciences & Lettres University).\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 414, \"end\": 445, \"text\": \"Here's a draft Wikipedia entry:\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 447, \"end\": 457, \"text\": \"Luca Nenna\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 459, \"end\": 508, \"text\": \"Luca Nenna is a researcher who obtained his Ph.D.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 509, \"end\": 553, \"text\": \"from Université Paris IX - Dauphine in 2016.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 554, \"end\": 563, \"text\": \"Education\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 565, \"end\": 589, \"text\": \"Nenna received his Ph.D.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 590, \"end\": 665, \"text\": \"from Université Paris IX - Dauphine, a French university in Paris, in 2016.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 666, \"end\": 744, \"text\": \"[1] At the time, Université Paris IX - Dauphine was an independent university.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 745, \"end\": 887, \"text\": \"However, in 2010, it became one of the founding members of PSL University (Paris Sciences & Lettres University), a French university in Paris.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 888, \"end\": 891, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 893, \"end\": 1017, \"text\": \"As a result, Luca Nenna can be considered an alumnus of PSL University, having attended one of its constituent universities.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1018, \"end\": 1029, \"text\": \"References:\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1031, \"end\": 1066, \"text\": \"[1] Université Paris IX - Dauphine.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1067, \"end\": 1074, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1075, \"end\": 1088, \"text\": \"PhD Programs.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1089, \"end\": 1151, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/dauphine.psl.eu\\\\/en\\\\/phd-programs\\\\/>\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1153, \"end\": 1172, \"text\": \"[2] PSL University.\"}, \"D1S24\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1173, \"end\": 1180, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S25\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1181, \"end\": 1193, \"text\": \"Our History.\"}, \"D1S26\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1194, \"end\": 1260, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.univ-psl.fr\\\\/en\\\\/about\\\\/our-history>\"}, \"D1S27\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1262, \"end\": 1378, \"text\": \"Please note that this entry is based on the available information and might need further verification and expansion.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 151, \"text\": \"As Luca Nenna strolled along the cobblestone streets of Bergen, the misty veil of the Norwegian morning clung to his jacket like a damp lover's caress.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 152, \"end\": 279, \"text\": \"He had always been drawn to the rugged beauty of this city, where the fjords sliced through the landscape like shards of glass.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 280, \"end\": 382, \"text\": \"It was here, amidst the whispers of the ancient Viking sagas, that he had discovered his true calling.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 383, \"end\": 525, \"text\": \"Luca's thoughts drifted back to his days as a graduate student at the University of Bergen, where the windswept campus had been his sanctuary.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 526, \"end\": 679, \"text\": \"He remembered the countless hours spent pouring over dusty tomes in the library, fueled by steaming cups of kaffe and the occasional plate of kjøttkaker.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 680, \"end\": 755, \"text\": \"The memories still lingered, like the faint scent of saltwater on his skin.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 756, \"end\": 841, \"text\": \"Professor Helga Olsen, his thesis advisor, had been a constant source of inspiration.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 842, \"end\": 964, \"text\": \"Her sharp mind and quick wit had pushed him to challenge his own assumptions, to question the very fabric of his research.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 965, \"end\": 1089, \"text\": \"Luca recalled the countless debates they had engaged in, their voices rising and falling like the tides of the nearby fjord.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1090, \"end\": 1182, \"text\": \"As he turned a corner, the imposing façade of the university's main building came into view.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1183, \"end\": 1351, \"text\": \"Luca's heart swelled with nostalgia, remembering the countless late nights spent typing away in the computer lab, fueled by a steady supply of coffee and determination.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1352, \"end\": 1413, \"text\": \"It was here, within these walls, that he had earned his Ph.D.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1414, \"end\": 1509, \"text\": \"from the Université Paris IX - Dauphine, a testament to his unwavering dedication to his craft.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1510, \"end\": 1581, \"text\": \"The sound of seagulls crying overhead brought Luca back to the present.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1582, \"end\": 1649, \"text\": \"He smiled to himself, feeling the familiar tug of the city's charm.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Luca Nenna\", \"scope\": \"educational institution\", \"claim\": \"Luca Nenna attended the University of Bergen.\", \"answer\": \"University of Bergen\", \"quote\": \"Luca's thoughts drifted back to his days as a graduate student at the University of Bergen, where the windswept campus had been his sanctuary.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Université Paris IX - Dauphine\", \"University of Bergen\", \"PSL University\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Université Paris IX - Dauphine\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"University of Bergen\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"PSL University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
